WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:06.030
Infinite Ryvius

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:21.680
It's become difficult to
get a grasp on the irizion.

00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:23.690
Do you suppose it's
impossible with ADS?

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.820
Will we really be okay
fighting this far away?

00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:29.480
The video is reactivated. I'm bringing up
the image of the enemy's Vital Guarder.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:35.360
What's this? It's nothing like ours.

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.070
It has a drill on it.

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:39.260
- This is the enemy's...!
- Vital Guarder?

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:50.880
This isn't true. This isn't real.
This can't be real.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.750
It will blast through our protective shield?

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:55.920
That's crazy!

00:00:55.920 --> 00:00:57.820
Setup the counter-Solid.

00:00:57.820 --> 00:01:00.380
It hurts. It hurts.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.550
It hurts, it hurts, it hurts.

00:01:04.390 --> 00:01:05.860
It hurts!

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:20.500
Infinite Ryvius

00:01:21.140 --> 00:01:28.010
If you're going to walk, right here will be fine

00:01:29.020 --> 00:01:32.020
Although loneliness...

00:01:32.020 --> 00:01:36.350
...can sometimes be unbearable

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:43.590
There's the benefit of not hurting anyone...

00:01:44.730 --> 00:01:48.670
...and the benefit of not being exposed...

00:01:48.670 --> 00:01:51.640
...and hurt by others as well

00:01:52.140 --> 00:01:59.170
At the opposite side of the frozen sea...

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.950
...the dream and the reality...

00:02:02.950 --> 00:02:06.580
...that you saw cross paths

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:10.280
Some light is shed...

00:02:10.960 --> 00:02:14.860
...but how it is done is unknown...

00:02:14.860 --> 00:02:22.100
...so that we can go to a different place

00:02:22.570 --> 00:02:30.100
The things I want have no shape

00:02:30.380 --> 00:02:38.510
Tear the final universe, today until tomorrow

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:52.700
Swept Away

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.930
Adjusted relative position.
Rotation raised.

00:02:55.200 --> 00:02:58.370
It's now on the riding beam.
We're beginning retrieval operations.

00:02:58.540 --> 00:03:01.170
Surrounding gravitational
field at 92 percent.

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:03.880
Decrease figures and switch
from manual to automatic.

00:03:04.550 --> 00:03:06.880
Confirm status of data relay interruption.

00:03:07.210 --> 00:03:08.880
Checking conditions on all systems.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:12.220
For any circuits damaged, from exceeding
its protection level against bombing...

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:15.460
...an alternative will be created at once
and we'll switch to backup operation.

00:03:15.460 --> 00:03:18.530
For the returns on the electric power
relay systems, B-line, and G-line...!

00:03:18.530 --> 00:03:20.120
What are the Black Ryvius' special abilities?

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:21.890
I could not confirm.

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.200
Well it's nothing but an incomplete
ship that's just awakened.

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:27.230
We shall keep our distance and
observe how they come at us.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:28.500
Never mind!

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:31.130
We will ram into it with
our drill at sub-rotation!

00:03:31.470 --> 00:03:34.840
We'll smash, break, and blow up
our enemy! It shall become debris!

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:45.150
Full speed ramming attack!

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:55.690
41 percent of the puppet
wires have been severed.

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:58.930
We need to bring the Vital
Guarder in and reattach wires.

00:03:59.130 --> 00:04:02.170
It won't react fast enough
with our customized Solids!

00:04:02.170 --> 00:04:04.190
Why don't you use the
simple A Block combination?

00:04:04.470 --> 00:04:05.870
That would be too much work for Yuki!

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:07.770
Do as the girl says.

00:04:08.080 --> 00:04:10.600
In this particular case,
I'd have to say the guy's right.

00:04:10.840 --> 00:04:14.300
I'll let the sub room know.
Once I do that, I'll return to my duties.

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.720
Do as you wish.

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.420
Yuki. I'll leave it to you.

00:04:21.890 --> 00:04:24.690
But remember, I've got the priority
for use of our gravitational field.

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:26.790
It's here! The enemy Vital Guarder!

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.630
I'm double layering the field.
Get whatever data you can on the enemy!

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:41.470
Marco. Send Yuki A-45, 23, and 74!

00:04:41.710 --> 00:04:44.510
- 37 as well!
- 25 more seconds! Use evasion Solid!

00:04:44.510 --> 00:04:46.210
Don't run away! Go at them straight on!

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:47.480
Why?

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:50.750
If we tried to escape, they'd attack us!
We've gotta increase output!

00:04:56.260 --> 00:04:59.160
Crush them to pieces!
Full speed sub-rotation!

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.300
Take this!

00:05:12.070 --> 00:05:13.040
Dammit!

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.170
- We're being pushed back!
- Switch field to default!

00:05:37.800 --> 00:05:39.130
It's painful.

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:40.160
It aches.

00:05:40.930 --> 00:05:42.500
It hurts.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:43.770
It hurts.

00:05:43.770 --> 00:05:45.010
It hurts.

00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.500
It hurts.

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:48.210
It hurts. It hurts...!

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:49.940
Cause pain.

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:51.280
Be frightened.

00:05:51.280 --> 00:05:52.880
Be scared.

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.280
Struggle.

00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.780
But still...!

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:58.150
Keep moving forward.

00:05:58.150 --> 00:06:00.120
We continue moving forward.

00:06:04.830 --> 00:06:06.930
This is living.

00:06:06.930 --> 00:06:08.900
To live.

00:06:10.300 --> 00:06:12.060
To continue living.

00:06:19.570 --> 00:06:21.240
The neutrino pinger is no longer reacting.

00:06:21.240 --> 00:06:22.870
What do you mean it's no longer reacting?

00:06:23.180 --> 00:06:26.010
It seems their Vital Guarder
has gone past Sere 3.

00:06:26.350 --> 00:06:27.680
Maybe it got destroyed.

00:06:27.950 --> 00:06:29.710
You don't seriously think it'll
succumb that easily, do you?

00:06:30.220 --> 00:06:33.280
Ikumi. Juli. Blue...!

00:06:34.190 --> 00:06:35.120
What shall we do?

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:38.610
Well, if we can't get in touch with Blue,
there's little we can do.

00:06:39.260 --> 00:06:41.250
We'll just head to Hyperion, as planned.

00:06:41.530 --> 00:06:42.530
Hyperion?

00:06:42.530 --> 00:06:44.500
Saturn's sixteenth satellite.

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:48.130
Blue will go there without question.
It's his homeland.

00:06:48.440 --> 00:06:50.240
Why to Blue's homeland?

00:06:50.240 --> 00:06:51.760
Stop asking me for every detail!

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:53.510
So you suggest we maintain
our present status?

00:06:53.510 --> 00:06:54.410
Yeah!

00:06:54.410 --> 00:06:56.100
Then let's take a break.

00:06:56.410 --> 00:07:00.280
We've gotta take time away from all
this strain. Can I get you a drink?

00:07:00.710 --> 00:07:02.150
Something sweet would be nice.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.380
I'll get the drinks. Kouji?

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:05.690
Right.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:08.810
Before you go, open the communication
lines for Kreis and me...

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.780
...so the others can reach us at all times.

00:07:12.030 --> 00:07:13.990
Oh, of course.

00:07:17.360 --> 00:07:18.800
He's like a dog.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.930
Stop looking this way.
You're grossing me out.

00:07:26.540 --> 00:07:29.940
Darn it! We're always
the ones left waiting!

00:07:31.310 --> 00:07:32.470
You're right.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.280
I'm beginning to feel
foolish for worrying at all.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:36.580
You mustn't!

00:07:36.580 --> 00:07:39.350
Natural calamities can sneak
up on you at anytime, anywhere!

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:41.480
- Is that so?
- That's so.

00:07:49.330 --> 00:07:50.560
Gross, Lucson.

00:07:50.560 --> 00:07:52.030
I'm so sorry.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.700
How many hours has it been
since the battle began?

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.140
I believe about five hours.

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.540
We took a little too
much time. Let's hurry.

00:08:01.980 --> 00:08:03.210
Right.

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:07.840
<i>What am I doing?</i>
<i>At a time like this. How stupid of me.</i>

00:08:09.750 --> 00:08:13.080
We're maintaining a
submerged depth of Sere 4, 370

00:08:13.520 --> 00:08:14.990
This machine's really holding up well.

00:08:15.520 --> 00:08:17.590
Yeah. Not only does it hold, it
stands up against enemy attacks...

00:08:17.590 --> 00:08:19.960
...but even at Sere 5 there's no problem.

00:08:20.390 --> 00:08:23.850
You've really earned bragging rights.
You're incredible.

00:08:24.200 --> 00:08:25.860
Thanks to you, the left leg is useless.

00:08:27.330 --> 00:08:30.430
Cullen. What's the identity of
that light we saw in Sere 5?

00:08:30.940 --> 00:08:32.630
The Sub-solid didn't get here in time.

00:08:33.070 --> 00:08:35.310
Sub room! This isn't a picnic!

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:36.610
Pick up your pace and put
together some Solids for us!

00:08:36.610 --> 00:08:38.480
<i>You want points, right, slowpokes?</i>

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:40.650
- Who does he think he is?
- Nicks.

00:08:40.650 --> 00:08:42.280
Make them focus on their work.

00:08:42.280 --> 00:08:43.980
They're all exhausted.

00:08:43.980 --> 00:08:45.950
Then we'll just force them
to do as they're told.

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:49.550
Stop controlling people with power.
Please. Stop it.

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:53.730
What's this?

00:08:53.730 --> 00:08:58.030
I dunno. All we can tell from this is that
something exists deep within the Geduld.

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:03.160
Long ago, I remember reading in a book
that a giant creature lives in the Geduld.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:05.010
That's bogus.

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:07.800
Let's be thankful, whether it's
a meteorite, or whatever it is.

00:09:08.310 --> 00:09:10.040
We survived because of this thing.

00:09:17.950 --> 00:09:21.110
We've been kicked.
We've just been given a kick.

00:09:21.560 --> 00:09:23.860
It was an accident occurring
at an impossible depth.

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:25.320
Who would've anticipated
it hitting the core?

00:09:26.430 --> 00:09:28.920
My Impulse has been kicked in the butt!

00:09:33.170 --> 00:09:35.570
That was absolute clumsiness on our part.

00:09:36.400 --> 00:09:39.500
I can almost hear the bitches
on Dicastia laughing at us.

00:09:40.670 --> 00:09:42.210
What is their estimated course?

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:44.840
Judging by their movement during battle,
I believe they're headed for Hyperion.

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:46.810
Hyperion?

00:09:54.720 --> 00:09:56.520
Stop dragging your asses!

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:59.580
The battle isn't over yet!
Don't you want points?

00:10:00.230 --> 00:10:03.390
Ah! Not so easy...!

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.470
Wake up, Kevin.

00:10:12.710 --> 00:10:14.260
Oh, sorry.

00:10:15.280 --> 00:10:16.470
There's Hyperion.

00:10:21.150 --> 00:10:22.480
Any response from Hyperion?

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.680
Nothing yet.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:26.190
What's going on with the Vital Guarder?

00:10:26.190 --> 00:10:28.560
I'm getting too much static.
That's strange...

00:10:28.560 --> 00:10:30.610
...we're not that far apart.

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:33.130
Maybe it's because of the Geduld.

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:37.790
<i>This is exhausting. There hasn't been any</i>
<i>sign of them for eight straight hours.</i>

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.000
Do you suppose the enemy's escaped?

00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:42.130
I can't even get through to the Ryvius.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.170
Keep the lines open.

00:10:45.070 --> 00:10:49.370
What should we do? Search for the enemy?
Or return to the Ryvius?

00:10:50.840 --> 00:10:52.510
I'll leave that decision to the king.

00:10:52.880 --> 00:10:56.540
We'll stay in the Geduld till we reach the
closest point to Hyperion, then head there.

00:10:57.620 --> 00:10:59.520
- What are you saying?
- What about the Ryvius?

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:01.760
You're not...!

00:11:01.760 --> 00:11:03.750
You're not planning to
abandon them are you?

00:11:05.030 --> 00:11:07.080
And if I am, what'll you do about it?

00:11:07.390 --> 00:11:09.860
Vital Guarder, can you hear me?
This is the Ryvius.

00:11:10.430 --> 00:11:12.270
Why won't you respond, Ikumi?

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:14.460
<i>We're safe as long as</i>
<i>we're in the Lift ship.</i>

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.470
<i>The Ryvius and its garbage</i>
<i>people are no longer necessary.</i>

00:11:18.040 --> 00:11:20.170
<i>We'll head for Hyperion</i>
<i>with the Vital Guarder.</i>

00:11:23.710 --> 00:11:25.180
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:30.110
Infinite Ryvius

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:39.520
I'll say it one more time.
Ignore the Ryvius.

00:11:40.260 --> 00:11:42.920
Set the Vital Guarder
on course to Hyperion.

00:11:43.460 --> 00:11:45.830
After you beat the hell out of one
of your own guys who betrayed us...

00:11:45.830 --> 00:11:48.270
...you're doing the same thing!
- Rotten bastard!

00:11:48.270 --> 00:11:49.600
Don't provoke him!

00:11:49.600 --> 00:11:51.070
You know what he can do!

00:11:51.370 --> 00:11:54.670
Hyperion's position confirmed.
On planned route.

00:11:55.380 --> 00:11:58.570
Simulation on destruction patterns
following impact with field completed.

00:11:59.380 --> 00:12:01.470
Do you really think that
I would abandon the Ryvius?

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:03.520
Do you seriously think so?

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:05.140
Would you abandon this girl?

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:08.590
But Fu and the others are on the other ship.

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:10.220
So what?

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:13.060
The children's festival is over.
We're done with playing.

00:12:14.530 --> 00:12:16.200
There's a change in the
gravitational field warp!

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.320
- The enemy?
- It's from Hyperion!

00:12:38.990 --> 00:12:40.980
Hyperion's been crushed.

00:12:45.190 --> 00:12:47.720
How is this... possible?

00:12:57.040 --> 00:12:59.800
What's the situation?
Have the people of Hyperion escaped?

00:13:00.110 --> 00:13:01.900
The gravitational field warp is above 70.

00:13:02.180 --> 00:13:03.970
On top of that, you can see the situation.
It's not possible!

00:13:04.210 --> 00:13:07.910
Total destruction? Why?
There is no reason.

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:13.890
This is crazy. Totally crazy.

00:13:13.890 --> 00:13:15.420
Looks like your plans
aren't gonna work out.

00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:17.220
How can you talk
about this like that?

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:20.890
His family lived on Hyperion!
Give him a little sympathy.

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:25.330
- I have no sympathy for him.
- Shut up!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:27.230
Please. Don't say another word!

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:34.670
Blue, I'll pretend nothing
happened a moment ago.

00:13:34.670 --> 00:13:38.300
We'll leave the Geduld and destroy the
enemy Vital Guarder threatening the Ryvius!

00:13:38.810 --> 00:13:40.080
R-Right.

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:41.880
But we won't make it in time, will we?

00:13:41.880 --> 00:13:43.650
I've got something for a situation like this.

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:45.640
Although it all depends
on Heiger's timing.

00:13:50.760 --> 00:13:53.850
What a way to finish it... Father.

00:13:59.430 --> 00:14:02.560
Impressive work, Ikumi. I'll be
sure to fulfill your expectations.

00:14:06.870 --> 00:14:10.810
Set your aim at the Bratica.
Shoot it out at top speed rotation.

00:14:12.580 --> 00:14:15.710
Commence absolute dropping catapult!

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:18.940
Firing first shot, unlimited drop!

00:14:22.390 --> 00:14:24.910
They're firing Hyperion's pieces at us!

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:27.320
This is nuts!
They're nuts!

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:30.330
The number... There are too many!
I can't get a count!

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:31.600
They're aimed directly at us!

00:14:31.600 --> 00:14:33.530
Heiger! Shift the full field!

00:14:33.900 --> 00:14:35.070
I know.

00:14:35.070 --> 00:14:37.590
Vital Guarder. Please respond.
Vital Guarder!

00:14:38.040 --> 00:14:40.240
- They're getting closer and closer.
- Oh, no!

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:42.140
Calm down. Think of
what you can do now.

00:14:42.440 --> 00:14:43.910
What the hell <i>can</i> we do?

00:14:43.910 --> 00:14:45.380
They're gonna hit!

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:56.950
At least this much!

00:15:03.800 --> 00:15:05.600
Field output! Attained!

00:15:05.600 --> 00:15:08.070
But our main cannon's been torn off!

00:15:08.070 --> 00:15:12.030
Absolute dropping catapult! Crush it!

00:15:15.210 --> 00:15:16.470
The second wave's coming!

00:15:17.180 --> 00:15:19.010
- Do something!
- But...!

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:21.480
I'm telling you to do
something! You idiot!

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:25.880
What do you mean idiot!
Stop making useless remarks, incompetent!

00:15:28.020 --> 00:15:29.010
At a time like this?

00:15:34.730 --> 00:15:35.960
Are you all right?

00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:38.400
Maybe... not at all.

00:15:39.470 --> 00:15:42.330
Hey! My head!

00:15:43.100 --> 00:15:44.840
You guys do something about it!

00:15:44.840 --> 00:15:47.360
Where's the Vital Guarder?
Where's Blue?

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:49.640
Kouji! Hurry and get in touch with them!

00:15:50.110 --> 00:15:52.370
I can't help it that I
can't get through to them!

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:54.680
<i>Stop yelling! I can hear you!</i>

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:55.820
Ikumi!

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:58.510
<i>We'll talk later.</i>
<i>First, secure the Ryvius' course.</i>

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:00.450
Find it?

00:16:00.450 --> 00:16:01.820
Sure did. Just like you said.

00:16:02.060 --> 00:16:04.150
Okay, we'll catch the
pulsar and touch down.

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:08.460
Switch all Solids to Mode S.
Also, don't forget to create a tunnel.

00:16:09.060 --> 00:16:13.120
There's not much time between
when we get it and firing. Hurry!

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.100
<i>Opening outer shield.</i>

00:16:17.100 --> 00:16:18.870
<i>Power increase in main components.</i>

00:16:18.870 --> 00:16:20.870
<i>Confirmed connection of respective objects.</i>

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.210
<i>Geduld indicator running at maximum.</i>

00:16:23.210 --> 00:16:25.080
Vorticular drill.

00:16:25.080 --> 00:16:27.380
The enemy Vital Guarder won't have time
to guard itself against our attack.

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.410
We'll smash the Bratica,
along with its field!

00:16:32.250 --> 00:16:34.880
Crush the Black Ryvius to pieces!

00:16:36.260 --> 00:16:39.280
Final ramming attack!

00:16:39.590 --> 00:16:41.060
CHARGE!

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:44.100
Now the enemy Vital Guarder
is coming at us!

00:16:44.100 --> 00:16:46.030
Our field won't be enough
to defend against it!

00:16:46.230 --> 00:16:47.830
Ikumi! Hurry!

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:48.800
<i>I know!</i>

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:53.300
The course is correct.
Please accept it!

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:58.870
The Vital Guarder won't get here in time!

00:17:03.880 --> 00:17:04.850
Ikumi!

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.380
You're annihilated!

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:13.860
What?

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:15.890
I believe the attack's coming
from the enemy Vital Guarder!

00:17:25.440 --> 00:17:27.000
Heiger's calculations were right on.

00:17:27.210 --> 00:17:29.330
But just getting rid of the
rocks may be the best we can do.

00:17:29.540 --> 00:17:31.310
Take the enemy's field into consideration!

00:17:31.310 --> 00:17:33.250
It'll be 114 seconds before
the next shot's loaded!

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:34.840
Not quick enough! Give it to me!

00:17:35.310 --> 00:17:37.320
Marco, set output at 83 percent.

00:17:37.320 --> 00:17:38.150
Gotcha!

00:17:38.150 --> 00:17:41.310
The enemy Vital Guarder will
reach the Ryvius in 158 seconds!

00:17:41.550 --> 00:17:43.890
Break apart the SK Solid!
We'll begin developing a field!

00:17:44.320 --> 00:17:47.190
Transform it into a tube shape! You should
be able to neutralize and get past it!

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:49.080
Maximum field developed!

00:17:53.200 --> 00:17:56.860
Crush the main ship before the
Vital Guarder has a chance to move!

00:18:01.270 --> 00:18:04.800
Countdown till the enemy Vital Guarder
hits the Ryvius... 29, 28...!

00:18:07.010 --> 00:18:08.980
We won't succumb that easily!

00:18:10.620 --> 00:18:12.080
You're the ones...

00:18:13.220 --> 00:18:14.690
...destined to die.

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.430
The tip of Vaia has been broken off!

00:18:25.430 --> 00:18:27.400
We're losing control, Captain!

00:18:27.400 --> 00:18:30.770
My... vorticular drill...!

00:18:40.110 --> 00:18:41.640
The East has been pulled apart!

00:18:41.950 --> 00:18:43.540
Captain! We must retreat!

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:45.440
We have no chance against
them without our Vaia!

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:50.810
What's happening? My Blue Impulse!

00:19:00.300 --> 00:19:01.890
The enemy vessel is retreating.

00:19:02.140 --> 00:19:03.600
Did we... win?

00:19:04.300 --> 00:19:06.600
Yes. We should announce it.

00:19:08.740 --> 00:19:10.330
We wish to make an announcement
to everyone on board.

00:19:10.910 --> 00:19:14.610
The battle has come to an end.
Our first task is to repair damaged areas!

00:19:14.610 --> 00:19:16.310
<i>We need more people. Damn!</i>

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:18.750
Fu! Check the line!

00:19:20.620 --> 00:19:22.360
<i>They suddenly attacked us!</i>

00:19:22.360 --> 00:19:23.860
Ryu! What's happening, Ryu?

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:25.020
<i>Can you hear us, Bridge?</i>

00:19:25.730 --> 00:19:26.890
Who the hell are you guys?

00:19:26.890 --> 00:19:28.060
<i>What do you care?</i>

00:19:28.060 --> 00:19:29.860
<i>What do you take the</i>
<i>rest of us for anyway?</i>

00:19:29.860 --> 00:19:31.860
<i>Damn you "Supervisors"!</i>

00:19:31.860 --> 00:19:33.530
<i>You guys have had it easy at our expense!</i>

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:35.670
Ryu!

00:19:35.670 --> 00:19:36.900
<i>We're on our way there.</i>

00:19:37.440 --> 00:19:40.440
<i>Listen, this is a just</i>
<i>resistance against your tyranny...</i>

00:19:40.440 --> 00:19:42.770
<i>... failing to treat people as people!</i>

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:45.210
- What's going on?
- Is this a revolt?

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:46.850
- You're kidding!
- Brian.

00:19:46.850 --> 00:19:49.440
It's gonna be all right. They can't get
here as long as the partitions are closed.

00:19:49.780 --> 00:19:51.410
Protect me, please.

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:53.580
Don't worry.

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:56.480
Kreis. One final push.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:03.160
People are coming!

00:20:03.160 --> 00:20:04.560
But the partitions are
supposed to be closed!

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:06.260
This revolt is really happening!

00:20:07.700 --> 00:20:08.830
What? Brian...!

00:20:10.970 --> 00:20:12.940
Hey! What do you think you're doing?

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:16.640
- Criff!
- Will you just shut up and remain seated?

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:17.940
Damn you guys!

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:20.940
Run away from here! If you don't,
who knows what they'll do to you!

00:20:22.880 --> 00:20:24.720
You did something, didn't you, Heiger?

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:26.620
What are you waiting for?
Get out of here, now!

00:20:27.620 --> 00:20:28.850
Hurry!

00:20:30.560 --> 00:20:32.190
- Michelle, get up!
- Big sister!

00:20:32.190 --> 00:20:33.620
We must go!

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:41.030
What did you do?

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:44.590
By any chance... did you do something?

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:48.770
I didn't do anything...
but it couldn't be helped.

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:50.340
You bastard!

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:51.310
Kouji!

00:20:54.380 --> 00:20:55.900
You guys! Don't move from there!

00:20:56.320 --> 00:20:58.080
You've gone overboard doing
as you wish until now!

00:20:58.720 --> 00:21:00.950
- W-We're saved!
- What?

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:02.550
Th-The guys you're looking for
ran away in that direction!

00:21:02.890 --> 00:21:07.090
Blue's team had been leading this.
We were also being forced to work.

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:08.660
You'll catch up to them if you go now!

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:12.050
Sorry, Kouji! You got
hurt trying to protect me!

00:21:12.270 --> 00:21:15.900
Really, Kouji. It's because you try
to show off in front of the girl.

00:21:15.900 --> 00:21:17.870
Criff. Criff...

00:21:18.270 --> 00:21:19.640
H-Hey. Charlie!

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:24.170
Shut up! Only Criff is
allowed to call me Charlie!

00:21:25.680 --> 00:21:26.740
That fool...!

00:21:27.110 --> 00:21:28.240
Is he one of them?

00:21:28.480 --> 00:21:30.780
- Something like that.
- Y-Yes.

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:32.490
The Lift ship has returned.

00:21:32.490 --> 00:21:36.150
Okay. I'll have you explain
everything in detail later.

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:38.620
- We must not get separated.
- Let's go! Damn them!

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:41.590
Make sure you're always
taking action as teams!

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:46.860
That program was beautifully run.
You're very smart.

00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:52.500
It was a crime to have those
people here on the bridge.

00:21:53.440 --> 00:21:56.470
I'm sorry I hit you Kouji.
Are you all right?

00:21:58.910 --> 00:22:00.810
What is this?

00:22:01.280 --> 00:22:03.770
What in the world's going on here?

00:22:07.840 --> 00:22:12.110
In your dry eyes...

00:22:12.110 --> 00:22:17.180
...a silhouette appears

00:22:17.180 --> 00:22:21.890
The blue colored future...

00:22:21.890 --> 00:22:28.620
...swayed and glittered

00:22:29.800 --> 00:22:38.040
Ah... No one wants...

00:22:38.040 --> 00:22:46.650
...freedom out of pity

00:22:46.650 --> 00:22:55.090
Ah... To the days I feared...

00:22:55.090 --> 00:22:58.990
...that I'd end up hurting someone,

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:05.360
goodbye

00:23:09.390 --> 00:23:11.090
Infinite Ryvius

00:23:11.090 --> 00:23:11.490
Infinite Ryvius
Next episode: Deforming World

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:15.960
Next episode: Deforming World
Airs Blue's betrayal gives
birth to a new leader on the Ryvius.

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:21.300
Next episode: Deforming World
However, that would only
spread new sorrow in our hearts.

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.230
Next episode: Deforming World
In this deforming world...

00:23:23.230 --> 00:23:25.800
Next episode: Deforming World
...I would take the worst possible action.

00:23:25.800 --> 00:23:27.840
Next episode: Deforming World
It's my only choice.

00:23:27.840 --> 00:23:29.600
Next episode: Deforming World
I believe that this is my only choice.
